                        Add  -->  Result  (  Double  )

                        Substract  -->  Type  (  Integer  )  //  Should  become  Operator  Type  Enum
                        Substract  -->  Result  (  Double  )

                        Multiply  -->  Type  (  Integer  )  //  Should  become  Operator  Type  Enum
                        Multiply  -->  Result  (  Double  )

                        Divide  -->  Type  (  Integer  )  //  Should  become  Operator  Type  Enum
                        Divide  -->  Result  (  Double  )

                        Power  -->  Type  (  Integer  )  //  Should  become  Operator  Type  Enum
                        Power  -->  Result  (  Double  )

                        Time Add  -->  Type  (  Integer  )  //  Should  become  Operator  Type  Enum
                        Time Add  -->  Result  (  Double  )

                        Time Substract  -->  Type  (  Integer  )  //  Should  become  Operator  Type  Enum
                        Time Substract  -->  Result  (  Double  )

                        Time Multiply  -->  Type  (  Integer  )  //  Should  become  Operator  Type  Enum
                        Time Multiply  -->  Result  (  Double  )

                        Time Divide  -->  Type  (  Integer  )  //  Should  become  Operator  Type  Enum
                        Time Divide  -->  Result  (  Double  )

                        Time Power  -->  Type  (  Integer  )  //  Should  become  Operator  Type  Enum
                        Time Power  -->  Result  (  Double  )

                  //  Partial  Operators

                        Sine  -->  Type  (  Integer  )  //  Should  become  Operator  Type  Enum
                        Sine  -->  Result  (  Double  )

                        Noise  -->  Type  (  Integer  )  //  Should  become  Operator  Type  Enum
                        Noise  -->  Result  (  Double  )

                  //  Standard  Custom  Operators

                        Adder  -->  Type  (  Integer  )  //  Should  become  Operator  Type  Enum
                        Adder  -->  Result  (  Double  )

                        //  Wave  Transforming  Effects  ...

                        //  Ear  Data  Transforming  Effect  ...

                  //  Black Box  &  Instrument  Operators

                        Black Box  -->  Type  (  Integer  )  //  Should  become  Operator  Type  Enum
                        Black Box  -->  Result  (  Double  )

                        Instrument  -->  Type  (  Integer  )  //  Should  become  Operator  Type  Enum
                        Instrument  -->  Result  (  Double  )

                  //  IO  Operators

                        Inlet  -->  Type  (  Integer  )  //  Should  become  Operator  Type  Enum
                        Inlet  -->  Result  (  Double  )

                        Outlet  -->  Type  (  Integer  )  //  Should  become  Operator  Type  Enum
                        Outlet  -->  Result  (  Double  )

                        Curve In  -->  Type  (  Integer  )  //  Should  become  Operator  Type  Enum
                        Curve In  -->  Result  (  Double  )

                        Sample Operator  -->  Type  (  Integer  )  //  Should  become  Operator  Type  Enum
                        Sample Operator  -->  Result  (  Double  )

                        Wave In Operator  -->  Type  (  Integer  )  //  Should  become  Operator  Type  Enum
                        Wave In Operator  -->  Result  (  Double  )

                        Midi File Operator  -->  Type  (  Integer  )  //  Should  become  Operator  Type  Enum
                        Midi File Operator  -->  Result  (  Double  )

                        Midi In Operator  -->  Type  (  Integer  )  //  Should  become  Operator  Type  Enum
